From fec29e00ea622cb0afe85426e42b861b61864248 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:41:10 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Guest Portal pages: passcode field, one success page, the
 quick connect sheet (102.8 line)

- Network page: the Free Wi-Fi passcode switch and field are back (wizard and Portal tab);
  choosing a VPN profile for a network switches that profile on; the Wi-Fi quick connect sheet
  waits for the print dialog instead of closing itself, and prints its colours.
- Sign-in page: the passcode the guest typed is sent again. After sign-in, when the first address
  is a phone's own connection test, the success page is loaded once more instead of being replaced
  by the test page, so no second, bare success page appears; a site typed into a computer's
  browser is still gone on to.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
